    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">immediately
    following the Share Capital Reduction, the Subdivision and Cancellation, the authorized share capital of the Company shall be US$50,000
    divided into 500,000,000,000 ordinary shares of a par value of US$0.0000001 each, comprising 400,000,000,000 Class A Ordinary Shares
